ned geophysicist and Fellow of the Royal Society."}, "D1S13": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 926, "end": 946, "text": "Studies and Research"}, "D1S14": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 948, "end": 1063, "text": "Lowrie's research at Cambridge focused on the application of seismic tomography to understand the Earth's interior."}, "D1S15": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1064, "end": 1245, "text": "His work led to several significant publications, including \"Seismic Tomography of the Earth's Mantle\" (1975) and \"Anisotropic Seismic Wave Propagation in the Earth's Crust\" (1978)."}, "D1S16": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1246, "end": 1351, "text": "These studies have been widely cited and have contributed significantly to the advancement of seismology."}, "D1S17": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1352, "end": 1362, "text": "References"}, "D1S18": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1364, "end": 1376, "text": "* Lowrie, W."}, "D1S19": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1377, "end": 1384, "text": "(1972)."}, "D1S20": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1385, "end": 1433, "text": "Seismic Wave Propagation in Heterogeneous Media."}, "D1S21": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1434, "end": 1439, "text": "Ph.D."}, "D1S22": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1440, "end": 1472, "text": "thesis, University of Cambridge."}, "D1S23": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1473, "end": 1501, "text": "* Lowrie, W., & McKenzie, D."}, "D1S24": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1502, "end": 1509, "text": "(1975)."}, "D1S25": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1510, "end": 1551, "text": "Seismic Tomography of the Earth's Mantle."}, "D1S26": {"document_number": 1, "doc_id": "d1", "start": 1552, "end": 1603, "text": "Journal of Geophysical Research, 80(11), 1473-1484."}, "D1S27": {"document_number": 1, "doc_i